<title>USA: Imperial Credit Industries Inc Q1 net off.</title>
<headline>Imperial Credit Industries Inc Q1 net off.</headline>
<dateline>TORRANCE, Calif. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.17		    $0.24</p>
<p> Net			  7,037		    8,616</p>
<p> Revs			40,295		   44,225</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  40,885		   35,271</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>'96 results includes $8.1 million gain on sale of servicing rights and the $3 million restructuring charge from exit from the conforming mortgage banking business.</p>
<p>'97 results includes pre-tax $4 million gain on sale of SPFC stock, and net of charge from retirement of debt.</p>
<p>Oper shr $0.27 vs $0.24.</p>
</text>
